    {
      "text": "Tut's scarab is glass a meteorite made.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "hook",
        "show": "gem",
        "shape": "oval",
        "tone": "#e8c53a",
        "color": "#f7c23a"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "King Tutankhamun wore a pectoral, an ornament for the chest.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "jewel",
        "piece": "necklace",
        "drop": "none",
        "label": "A pectoral",
        "velvet": "#5bb4e8",
        "color": "#4cc3a8"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Its central scarab beetle is carved from yellow glass.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "reveal",
        "item": "gem",
        "shape": "oval",
        "tone": "#e8c53a",
        "label": "Canary-yellow glass",
        "light": "#fff2c4",
        "color": "#ec6a9c"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "At first, it was listed as the mineral chalcedony.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Chalcedony",
        "sub": "The first guess",
        "color": "#a98be0"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Later, it was identified as Libyan Desert Glass.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Libyan Desert Glass",
        "sub": "The answer",
        "color": "#f0552e"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That glass lies scattered across the sand dunes of Egypt's western desert.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "plain",
        "name": "Western desert",
        "role": "Egypt",
        "color": "#f7c23a",
        "cast": [
          {
            "outfit": "coat",
            "outfitColor": "#c9b48a",
            "hair": "short",
            "hairColor": "#2e2420",
            "skin": "#efc9a6",
            "expression": "focused",
            "hat": "helmet"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In 1932, an Englishman named Patrick Clayton",
      "say": "In nineteen thirty-two, an Englishman named Patrick Clayton",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "cast",
        "setting": "plain",
        "name": "Patrick Clayton",
        "role": "1932",
        "color": "#5bb4e8",
        "cast": [
          {
            "outfit": "coat",
            "outfitColor": "#8a7a5a",
            "hair": "short",
            "hairColor": "#6a4a30",
            "skin": "#efc9a6",
            "expression": "focused",
            "hat": "helmet",
            "prop": "magnifier"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "found pieces of it in the Libyan desert.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "reveal",
        "item": "rough",
        "tone": "#e8c53a",
        "label": "Found in the sand",
        "light": "#fff2c4",
        "color": "#4cc3a8"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Scientists say it formed about 29 million years ago",
      "say": "Scientists say it formed about twenty-nine million years ago",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "29 million",
        "sub": "About",
        "color": "#ec6a9c"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "when a meteorite hit the desert and melted the sand.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Sand melted",
        "sub": "A meteorite hit the desert",
        "color": "#f0552e"
      }
    },
    {
